Nitro+ PAK format reference
----------------------------

The Nitro+ PAK v2/v3 reader in Aura was independently implemented using the
public GARbro format implementation as a technical reference:

https://github.com/morkt/GARbro/blob/master/ArcFormats/NitroPlus/ArcNitro.cs

GARbro is copyright (C) 2015-2016 by morkt and is distributed under the MIT
License. The reference implementation's MIT license permits use, modification,
and distribution subject to retaining the copyright and permission notice.

Aura's Kotlin implementation is a separate implementation and does not include
the original C# source file. This notice is retained for attribution and
traceability of the format reference.
